---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const amazonActive = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_AMAZON_ASSOCIATE_ACTIVE === 'true';
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate disclosure" description="Information about our planned Amazon Associates participation and how affiliate links may support this website.">
  <div class="content-container simple-page prose"><span class="eyebrow">Transparency</span><h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>{amazonActive && <p class="intro"><strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong></p>}<p>Visha Tech Picks intends to use Amazon Associates India links after account and eligibility steps are completed. As of this pre-launch source build, no affiliate tracking IDs or affiliate purchase links are configured.</p><p>If a future article contains an affiliate link, we will clearly identify it near the link (for example, “paid link”). A qualifying purchase may earn us a commission under the programme terms.</p><p>Affiliate relationships do not guarantee that a product is right for you. We encourage readers to compare specifications, warranty, seller information and final checkout prices independently.</p><p>For more detail, read our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>.</p></div>
</BaseLayout>
